     1,
     "<div>Hi Ling-Hui,</div><div><br></div><div>Please try:</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># title: date format in X-axis</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># date: 2013.7.10</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>URL &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"http://ichart.finance.yahoo.com/table.csv?s=AAPL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ichart.finance.yahoo.com/table.csv?s%3DAAPL&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238807942000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zUYv5gBdC7dmJUwWtKeFi\">http://ichart.finance.yahoo.com/table.csv?s=AAPL</a>&quot;</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>dat &lt;- read.csv(URL)</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>dat$Date &lt;- as.Date(dat$Date, &quot;%Y-%m-%d&quot;)</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>dat &lt;- dat[order(dat$Date), ]</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>plot(dat$Close ~ dat$Date, xaxt = &quot;n&quot;, type=&quot;l&quot;)</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>xlabels &lt;- seq(1, length(dat$Date), round(length(dat$Date)/20,0))</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>axis(side=1, dat[xlabels,]$Date, labels=format(dat[xlabels,]$Date,&quot;%Y-%m&quot;), cex.axis=0.8)</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># end</b></font></div></div><div><br></div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">說明:</font><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">1. as.Date 轉換為日期格式</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">2. xlabels 設定約20個x 軸刻度文字的index</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">3. axis 中的 format參數轉換顯示為英文格式 年-月</font></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-MQVdHowXFPg/UdxcuEGxK3I/AAAAAAAAAWw/6RIk7CKoKbY/s1600/date+format+in+X-axis.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-MQVdHowXFPg/UdxcuEGxK3I/AAAAAAAAAWw/6RIk7CKoKbY/s1600/date%2Bformat%2Bin%2BX-axis.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238807942000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2i1iJsho_CwJ0VZbzCdKm5\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-MQVdHowXFPg/UdxcuEGxK3I/AAAAAAAAAWw/6RIk7CKoKbY/s320/date+format+in+X-axis.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"165\"></a></p><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font><br>王鈴慧於 2013年6月26日星期三UTC+8下午5時11分17秒寫道：</div>"
